The game itself is not part of this repository or its images: the plugin is built against the Valheim dedicated server
as published on Steam (plugin/fetch-refs.sh), and loads into it at runtime.

The demo on GitHub Pages shows the game's item icons, item and creature stats and player figures. They are Iron
Gate's, not covered by the MIT license and not in this repository: the Pages workflow extracts them from the dedicated
server at build time (tools/extract_gamedata.py, tools/render_looks.py), as every deployment does for its own page.
